#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: wirecore-order-archive-cleaner.php
msgid "WireCore Order Archive Cleaner for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: wirecore-order-archive-cleaner.php
msgid "Moves old WooCommerce orders to an \"Archived\" status without deleting them – automatically, with rules, scheduled exports, retention and webhooks."
msgstr "Verschiebt alte WooCommerce-Bestellungen in den Status „Archiviert“, ohne sie zu löschen – automatisch, mit Regeln, geplanten Exporten, Aufbewahrungsfrist und Webhooks."

#. Author of the plugin
#: wirecore-order-archive-cleaner.php
msgid "WireCore GmbH"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: wirecore-order-archive-cleaner.php
msgid "https://wirecore.net"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:63
#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:67
msgid "Order Archive"
msgstr "Bestellarchiv"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:84
#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-dashboard.php:77
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:119
msgid "If the webhook is enabled by an administrator, every archived order is sent to the configured HTTPS address, including the order ID, order number, previous status, customer email address, total, currency, order date and the address of this site. Scheduled exports and the backup before deletion send archived orders with customer names and email addresses as CSV file to the configured email address."
msgstr "Wenn ein Administrator den Webhook aktiviert, wird jede archivierte Bestellung an die eingestellte HTTPS-Adresse gesendet, darunter Bestell-ID, Bestellnummer, vorheriger Status, E-Mail-Adresse des Kunden, Gesamtbetrag, Währung, Bestelldatum und die Adresse dieser Website. Geplante Exporte und die Sicherung vor dem Löschen senden archivierte Bestellungen mit Namen und E-Mail-Adressen der Kunden als CSV-Datei an die eingestellte E-Mail-Adresse."

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:196
msgid "Insufficient permissions."
msgstr "Keine ausreichenden Berechtigungen."

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:246
msgid "Archiving"
msgstr "Archivierung"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:250
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Regeln"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:254
msgid "Export & retention"
msgstr "Export & Aufbewahrung"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:258
msgid "Integrations"
msgstr "Integrationen"

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:280
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Einstellungen gespeichert."

#: includes/class-wirecore-oac-admin.php:287
msgid "Saved. The webhook URL was discarded – it has to be a public HTTPS address."
msgstr "Gespeichert. Die Webhook-URL wurde verworfen – sie muss eine öffentliche HTTPS-Adresse sein."

